       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ZBUF.
      * RECEIVE BUFFER: the whole screen, as a Read Buffer returns it.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-BUF    PIC X(2000).
       01 WS-LEN    PIC S9(4) COMP VALUE 2000.
       01 WS-LINE.
          05 FILLER PIC X(13) VALUE 'BUFFER BYTES '.
          05 WS-N   PIC 9999.
          05 FILLER PIC X(1) VALUE SPACE.
          05 WS-HEAD PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           EXEC CICS RECEIVE BUFFER INTO(WS-BUF) LENGTH(WS-LEN) END-EXEC
           MOVE WS-LEN TO WS-N
           MOVE WS-BUF(1:4) TO WS-HEAD
           EXEC CICS SEND TEXT FROM(WS-LINE) LENGTH(22) ERASE END-EXEC
           EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
